# Allowed domains for HAProxy domain filtering
# One domain per line (without http:// or https://)
# 
# Supported formats:
# - Exact domain: example.com
# - Wildcard subdomain: .example.com (note: dot at the beginning, matches *.example.com)
#   This will match: api.example.com, www.example.com, any.example.com, etc.
# - Exact subdomain: api.example.com
#
# IMPORTANT: For wildcard domains, use .example.com (with leading dot) instead of *.example.com
# This allows HAProxy to match any subdomain using suffix matching
#
# Examples:
# example.com
# www.example.com
# api.example.com
# .example.com          # Matches *.example.com (any subdomain)
# .mydomain.com         # Matches *.mydomain.com (any subdomain)
# test.example.org
